#UI BMS4, created by Revientor and Naldo (2009)
#This is the main TEAMS Editor Window when you click on TEAMS in the editor left side.


#UI BMS 4.38 update, May 2023, by Kolbe

#This controls the Teams settings in the TE Edit window.

It contains:
#- Team Flags
#- Team Settings
#- Mission Statement
#- Team Territory (Map)


